Adventurer,

A new Dev Talk is here! Following our recent introductions to *Shapeshifter=
* weapons and *Tracking* , this video explores another exciting feature on =
its way to Albion: *Awakened* and *Legendary Items*.

( https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3DuvuB5unjaeE )

For a written summary, click *here* ( https://albiononline.com/news/dev-tal=
k-awakened-legendary ).

The Divine Challenge is Here
----------------------------

The *Divine Challenge* is back! For the entire month of August, you can ear=
n points for open-world activities, unlock chests to get valuable loot, and=
 claim your very own *Divine Owl* - a ghostly, swift, white flying mount.

( https://albiononline.com/news/divine-challenge-2023 )

In addition, you can unlock the *Divine Challenge Avatar Ring* , and mystic=
al furniture items like the *Mage Statue* , *Magic Rune Circle* , and *Glas=
s Sphere*. So log in, head out into the open world, gather points, and clai=
m these rewards while you can!

Claim the Alpaca with a Single Referral!
----------------------------------------

A new *referral season* is here, and from now until the end of August you c=
an get the *Alpaca* mount skin with a single referral!

( https://albiononline.com/news/referral-august-2023 )

This splendid skin gives your *Giant Stag* base mount a uniquely noble grac=
e and proud posture as it carries your character across Albion=E2=80=99s bi=
omes. Once you=E2=80=99ve unlocked the skin, it can be used by any of your =
characters on that particular server ( *either Albion East or West* ).

This Referral Season lasts until *23:59:59 UTC* on *August 31* , so invite =
your friends and enjoy these rewards!

